SUMMARY:The Secret Agent
DTSTART:20251231T210000Z
DTEND:20251231T235500Z
DTSTAMP:20251231T210000Z
UID:FyFP0KkTO6
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 159 mins (2h39m)\n\nKleber Mendonça Filho (Bacurau)
  returns with a thrillingly unpredictable\, shape-shifting epic set in his
  hometown of Recife during the late 1970s\, starring a magnetic Wagner Mou
 ra as a man on the run from his past.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-th
 eaters/the-secret-agent\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
