  into a tour de force of space-age modernism. 4K restoration. Introduced
  by SIFF Cinema Staff Member Lily Rocklage.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/progra
 ms-and-events/siff-movie-club/ikarie-xb-1\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
