BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Ride Why
DTSTART:20260222T030000Z
DTEND:20260222T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20260222T030000Z
UID:8twWRN9ttr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nPresented by Cascade Bicycle Clu
 b\, Cascade Bicycle Studio\,and Noir Rouge Productions We Ride Why is a d
 ocumentary film about the power of love\, community\, and hope in the face
  of cancer. The film follows the stories of several women who have been im
 pacted by cancer\, as well as the friends and family who support them. Thr
 ough their stories\, we learn about the collateral damage that cancer can 
 bring\, but also the hope that can be found in the relationships that are 
 born out of trauma.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/we-ride-why
 -x40948\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
